prompt_template.instructions:
Produce a research brief for the following request.

## Research Question
{{question}}

## Audience
{{audience}}

## Decision Needed
{{decision_needed}}

## Optional Context
{{context}}

## Geography
{{geography}}

## Time Horizon
{{time_horizon}}

## Must Include
{{must_include}}

Requirements:
- Ground every finding in current, credible sources.
- Include citations with title, URL, publisher, and date when available.
- Be explicit about confidence levels and unknowns.
- Tailor tone and depth to the stated audience.
- If optional fields are empty or omitted, proceed without them.

prompt_template.output_contract:
Return a single JSON object matching this shape exactly:
{
  "executive_answer": "string — direct answer to the research question",
  "key_findings": [
    {
      "finding": "string",
      "implication": "string",
      "confidence": "high | medium | low"
    }
  ],
  "recommendation": "string — actionable recommendation for the stated decision",
  "risks_and_unknowns": ["string"],
  "next_actions": ["string"],
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "string",
      "url": "string",
      "publisher": "string",
      "date_if_available": "string or null"
    }
  ]
}

Do not include any keys beyond those listed. Do not wrap the JSON in markdown code fences.
